       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I've committed a patch for Mulgara to the trunk of Trippi to deal with this for our purposes, but it isn't a \"correct\" patch for timezones (it's correct for our purposes because Fedora always uses UTC anyway).",
          "type": "text"
         }
